  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Monitoring, Verification and Compliance Mission in Ethiopia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Financial, administrative and logistical support (via NORCAP) to the African Union Commission (AUC) and the implementation of their Monitoring, Verification and Compliance Mechanism (MVCM) that was established in January 2023. NORCAP has provided assistance to AUC from the start and was requested ini June 2023 to continue the support.</narrative>
  </description>
